      "role": "user",
      "content": "changing my mindset doesn't really change the reality though. the machine keeps running. i wake up, i do the same things, i deal with the same people. it's not even burnout, it's just... fundamental. like the light's been turned off and i'm just a ghost inhabiting a suit. i just want the noise to stop. i just want everything to be quiet for once.",
